<title>USA: Fed buys coupons -- market sources.</title>
<headline>Fed buys coupons -- market sources.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve was said to be buying coupons in the domestic money market on Wednesday, money market sources said.</p>
<p>The Fed was said to be buying coupons from June 1999 to May 2002. The delivery date was said to be Thursday.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
